# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the PawWatch site.
#
# /home/ used to be the home page. The home page is at / now, so
# /home/ sends visitors there permanently. Anything still pointing at
# the old address (an old bookmark, a link in an app store listing, a
# search result) should land on the home page rather than at a 404.
#
# The site is built with Astro's directory format, so the home page is
# served at / and /home/ needs to redirect rather than be a page of
# its own.

/home/    /    301
